{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o213","title":"温恢为扬州刺史济为别驾","time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},"order":3139,"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"扬州刺史","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"别驾","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"令曰季子为臣吴宜有君、今君还州吾无忧矣","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o122","title":"温恢一朝尽散家财赈施宗族，州里比之郇越","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b"]},"order":3335,"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"内足于财，以为世方乱安以富为，一朝尽散，赈施宗族，州里高之，比之郇越","evidence":["liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o126","title":"太祖以温恢出为扬州刺史，遣蒋济还州佐之","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]},"order":3336,"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"以恢出为扬州刺史，称甚欲使卿在亲近、顾以为不如此州事大，欲得蒋济为治中，乃遣济还州；语张辽、乐进等，扬州刺史晓达军事，动静与共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"出为扬州刺史；被嘱诸将与其动静共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"时为丹杨太守，被遣还州","evidence":["liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba"]},{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"受嘱与温恢共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]},{"person":"wudi-p0236","role":"受嘱与温恢共咨议","evidence":["liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o128","title":"温恢谓裴潜：畏征南有变，关羽骁锐乘利而进必将为患","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]},"order":3338,"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"谓裴潜，此间虽有贼不足忧，而畏征南方有变；今水生而子孝悬军无有远备，关羽骁锐乘利而进必将为患，于是有樊城之事；密语潜，此必襄阳之急欲赴之也，所以不为急会者不欲惊动远众，一二日必有密书促卿进道；张辽等又将被召，辽等素知王意，后召前至，卿受其责","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0182","role":"兖州刺史，受言；受诏书召，缓之；受其言，置辎重，更为轻装速发，果被促令","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]},{"person":"liusima-p0016","role":"豫州刺史，受诏书召","evidence":["liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564"]},{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"等寻各见召，如恢所策","evidence":["liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o132","title":"温恢赴凉州道病卒，时年四十五","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},"order":3339,"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"道病卒，时年四十五；卒后被追愍褒奖","evidence":["liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"诏褒恢有柱石之质，服事先帝功勤明著，及为朕执事忠于王室，授万里之任，如何不遂吾甚愍之，赐恢子生爵关内侯","evidence":["liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]},{"person":"liusima-p0044","role":"温恢子，受赐爵关内侯","evidence":["liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"hancui-e-1685dd5682f2c2c083c9","title":"孙礼私纵犯法马台自首温恢白曹操两人减死","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},"order":4981,"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0031","role":"纵囚自首","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"hancui-p-0486205b9fd135","role":"获纵减死","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"白事","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"减死","evidence":["hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"]}],"accounts":[]}],"persons":[{"id":"chengguo-p0023","name":"温恢","evidence":["chengguo-q-ee3917cc7f22f638be28","liusima-q-6a9eb3b6c03d531dcd9b","liusima-q-22fa782cfbf504c9dfba","liusima-q-350bc172c319b34af315","liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-f886ceb57697a5567d32","liusima-q-60d272e09d7cb8900f05","liusima-q2-d67f064fec46425a2d58","liusima-q-13bbdbe79d3f464e0013","liusima-q-d4d9c0a5938afbdb08f3","liusima-q2-cf8d0bbf9e73861bdddd","hancui-q-1a2b429226964923222e"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-89452e991248726a6129","text":"字曼基，太原祁人。父恕为涿郡太守；恢十五岁丧父，送丧归乡里。","evidence":["liusima-q2-d67f064fec46425a2d58"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-d4fba1d45969ba67cd05","text":"举孝廉，为廪丘长，迁鄢陵、广川令，彭城、鲁相，入为丞相主簿。","evidence":["liusima-q-13bbdbe79d3f464e0013"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-52461eed0c8f8d560294","text":"文帝践阼，为侍中，出为魏郡太守。","evidence":["liusima-q-d4d9c0a5938afbdb08f3"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-fbcdf61276e6b017216a","text":"迁凉州刺史，持节，领护羌校尉；道病卒，时年四十五。","evidence":["liusima-q2-cf8d0bbf9e73861bdddd"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
